cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "QVSh: offline cross-layer verification of concurrent crosstalk in shared quantum processors"
abstract: >-
  Pulse-level simulation, single-qubit process reconstruction and workload
  replay for auditing how concurrent crosstalk in a shared quantum processor
  degrades scheduler-visible workload reliability. Reports process infidelity,
  a coherent and an incoherent deviation metric, a three-way channel verdict,
  and expected, worst-case and spread output-state fidelities.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-15"
license: MIT
